flowchart TD
    A[Gradient computed by backprop] --> B[Optimizer applies update rule]
    B --> C[Parameters actually move]
    C --> D[Next forward and loss change]

    B --> E[Update too small]
    B --> F[Update practical]
    B --> G[Update too large]

    E --> H[Almost no movement]
    F --> I[Closer to target]
    G --> J[Overshoots target]
